  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fish Scale Gu is used with Stealth Rock Gu to create Stealth Scales Gu. Fang Yuan needs the Fish Scale Gu for that refine, and that recipe would only be discovered two hundred years later, so Qing Shu has no clue why Fang Yuan wants it.",
        "chapters": [
          123
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-lines",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_stealth_rock_gu",
          "gu_stealth_scales_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Shu instead names the common line into rank two Scale Armor Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          123
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-lines",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the refine, the finished Stealth Scales Gu is a fossilised carp, grey throughout, with realistic fish scales in Fang Yuan’s primeval sea.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-lines",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That form belongs to Stealth Scales Gu, not to Fish Scale Gu as a separate worm.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-lines",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He obtained the Fish Scale Gu that way, then refined Stealth Scales Gu from it before the Gu battle tournament. It is written once as Fish Scales Gu when he notes he no longer needs to exchange merit for one.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-and-fuses-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_stealth_scales_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
